==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*6 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baron Face]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you've been gathering a lot of currency, here is where its going to pay off. Take care of the Malizabeth with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] and [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Rangers]], while [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cats]] brute forces Metal Hippoe's health bar. The Otta-smack-us would be the most threatening pushers here, but are luckily unbuffed and thus easy to take care of with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] alongside King Dragon Cats, given good enough meatshielding. Once you're able to isolate Baron Face, start swarming him with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] until he dies. He can't push at all on his own, so once his supports are exhausted, he won't be able to keep up.

